// O1 Odoo workers at their limits (docs/specs/round-2.md#signals): from the log reader's counts, a bin with at least
// MinKills worker ends Odoo states itself (the Kinds: limits, timeouts, critical errors; inferred kills are not alerted).
// Parameters: TargetEnv, Start, End, Kinds, MinKills, BinSize.
OdooLog_CL
| where TimeGenerated between (Start .. End) and Env == TargetEnv and Kind in (Kinds)
| summarize n = sum(Count) by Kind, Bin = bin_at(TimeGenerated, BinSize, Start)
| summarize Kills = sum(n), ByKind = make_bag(bag_pack(Kind, n)) by Bin
| where Kills >= MinKills
| project Bin, Kills, ByKind
